:MENUGRP.Related Command Menus
:MENUI OPTION=27 ACTION='MENU CMDBSCF' HELP='CMDFILE/OPT27'.BSC File Commands  CMDBSCF
:MENUI OPTION=28 ACTION='MENU CMDCMNF' HELP='CMDFILE/OPT28'.Communications File Commands  CMDCMNF
